privacyDesc:"Information about how your details are handled.",privacyLocalOnlyTitle:"Local storage",privacyLocalOnlyDesc:"Everything you enter – names, allergies, and notes – stays on this specific device. We save nothing online and we have no servers collecting your data.",privacyEncryptionTitle:"Encryption",privacyEncryptionDesc:"To prevent unauthorized access, the information is automatically encrypted before it is saved on the device.",privacyDeletionTitle:"Delete data",privacyDeletionDesc:"Do you want to clear everything? No problem. Just use 'Reset App' and all data will be permanently deleted from the device.",privacyResponsibleTitle:"Your responsibility",privacyResponsibleDesc:"Since everything is saved locally with you, it is you (or the preschool) who is responsible for keeping the device secure and that the information is handled correctly.",privacyNote:"Everything stays on your device. Nothing is sent to any server.",privacyDetailedInfo:`We believe privacy is super important. That is why we built KinderKit so that all information you enter – whether it is the children's names, allergies, or schedules – is saved directly on your own device (the phone, tablet, or computer you use).

Nothing is sent over the internet and we have no cloud services looking at your data. This means you have 100% control. We help you along the way by encrypting the data in the background.

If you want to move the information to another device, you can use 'Export Data'. Keep in mind that if you clear your browser's history/cache or click on 'Reset App', all your data will be permanently deleted.`,accessibilityTitle:"Accessibility",accessibilityInfo:"We strive to make KinderKit accessible to everyone. The app uses clear contrasts and shapes to complement colors. We have also designed the app with large, clear tap targets to work optimally on touch screens, and added support so that the app can be easily read by screen readers in the future.",dangerZone:"Administrative actions",clearGroups:"Reset all groups",clearGroupsDesc:"Sets all children as 'Unassigned' in all categories for the selected class.",clearDept:"Clear class",clearDeptDesc:"Removes ALL children from the current class. This cannot be undone.",confirmClearAllGroups:"Are you sure you want to reset all group placements for all children in this class?",confirmResetDept:"Are you absolutely sure you want to delete ALL children from this class?",groupsCleared:"All group placements have been reset.",deptCleared:"The class has been cleared of children.",menuManageTitle:"Management & Children",menuManageDesc:"Manage child groups, classes, and information.",menuCreateTitle:"Create material",menuCreateDesc:"Smart tools to quickly design and print educational material.",whatToCreate:"What would you like to do today?",menuNametagsTitle:"Nametags",menuNametagsDesc:"Create nametags, shelf labels, and clothes pegs!",nametags:"Nametags",gatheringMat:"Tables and gathering mats",gatheringDesc:"Visualize seating arrangements and gathering spots!",createList:"Lists",listDesc:"Tailor attendance lists, learning logs, diaper logs, and more!",shelfLabels:"Shelf Strips & Labeling",shelfDesc:"Print clear shelf strips and tags using colors.",groupTool:"Group division",groupDesc:"Quickly and easily divide the child group into smaller groups via drag-and-drop.",manageChildren:"Children, Staff & Class",manageChildrenDesc